(:id "port/goose/vt/build-version" :state :done :evidence ("internal/codegen/goosetable/buildversion_test.go: TestGooseBuildVersion, TestGooseBuildVersionNegativeControl (block-check, cook-check and cook-write controls each red on their own clause)") :tested-revision "e3ba5d91c6f85d18c3e366fe723cf870834b09cf" :note "2026-11-02: the generated BuildVersion equals ir.BuildVersion and the version the C++ reference stamped into both block images; all 64 version bits refuse wrong_build_version on block and cook open, before alignment and truncation; the cook writer stamps byte 8 in both byte orders. PR #2705.")
